<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <style>
        .container {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            padding: 20px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .otp {
            font-size: 26px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #DC2626;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }

        .warning {
            color: #6B7280;
            font-size: 13px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h2>Password Reset Request</h2>
        <p>We received a request to reset your password for your CodeShift account.</p>
        <p>Your password reset OTP code is:</p>

        <div class="otp">
            <%= otp %>
        </div>

        <p>This code will expire in <%= expirationMinutes %> minute(s).</p>

        <p class="warning">
            If you did not request a password reset, please ignore this email or contact support if you have concerns.
        </p>

        <p>Best regards,<br>The CodeShift Team</p>
    </div>
</body>

</html>